; focus ramp: tilt the scrap, far end (x=190) up 10mm
; generated by emitter.py
; lines along X at y=15 F300, y=30 F500, y=45 F800 (100%), y=60 F3000 20% mark
; focal offset runs 0 -> 10mm along each line: thinnest mark = focus,
; how far the F300 line still cuts through = usable beam depth
;
;HEAD: laser
;MATERIAL: mdf_3mm
;LASER_MODE: static  (M3 — dwell-burn-through risk if motion stalls)

$32=1   ; GRBL laser mode
G21     ; mm
G90     ; absolute
M5      ; laser off
G0 X0 Y0

; --- path 1/4: F300 100% x1 ---
G0 X10.000 Y15.000
M3 S1000
F300
G1 X12.500 Y15.000
G1 X10.000 Y15.000
G1 X190.000 Y15.000
M5

; --- path 2/4: F500 100% x1 ---
G0 X10.000 Y30.000
M3 S1000
F500
G1 X14.167 Y30.000
G1 X10.000 Y30.000
G1 X190.000 Y30.000
M5

; --- path 3/4: F800 100% x1 ---
G0 X10.000 Y45.000
M3 S1000
F800
G1 X16.667 Y45.000
G1 X10.000 Y45.000
G1 X190.000 Y45.000
M5

; --- path 4/4: F3000 20% x1 ---
G0 X10.000 Y60.000
M3 S200
F3000
G1 X15.000 Y60.000
G1 X10.000 Y60.000
G1 X190.000 Y60.000
M5

G0 X0 Y0
